{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《女神配對計劃2》陳若思近日人氣急升，最新一集更大方卸妝，以睡衣造型展現自然一面。然而，這位如今備受矚目的女神 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《女神配對計劃2》陳若思近日人氣急升，最新一集更大方卸妝，以睡衣造型展現自然一面。然而，這位如今備受矚目的女神，原來11年前曾是網片中的無名小角色！從沒有對白的茄喱啡，到鏡頭前大跳熱舞的偽女團成員，她的青澀演出逐一被翻出，背後更牽涉一段曾經鬧得沸沸揚揚的富豪緋聞。\n</p>\n<h2>節目水族館露營陳星妤陳若思素顏上陣</h2>\n<p>製作組在巨型海洋景觀玻璃牆前搭建多個溫暖浪漫露營帳篷，安排女神與求愛勇者進行夜宿體驗。陳星妤換上深色長袖居家服展現精緻立體五官，而陳若思則穿上超可愛黑白卡通狗圖案睡衣亮相。戴上黑框眼鏡並愜意躺臥在帳篷內陳若思，對著鏡頭燦爛微笑兼比出V字手勢，展現鄰家女孩氣質。</p>\n<h2>揭秘陳若思十九歲演出網片心酸血淚</h2>\n<p>原來早在11年前陳若思就已經涉足娛樂圈，19歲時曾連續兩屆擔任官方活動模特兒。當年她以本名陳紫瑩拍攝YouTube網片，參演過不少零對白小角色，包括在劇集《PA血淚史》中飾演偽女團成員跳二創歌曲《Sugar Daddy》，又曾於拳擊網片擔任舉牌小姐大騷纖腰。直到2015年她憑藉出眾顏值加入鍾培生旗下電競公司擔任電競模特兒。</p>\n<h2>陳若思堅決否認曾遭鍾培生包養傳聞</h2>\n<p>陳若思過往與電競公司老闆鍾培生緋聞再度成為討論焦點。早在2022年外界曾瘋傳兩人曾有一段情甚至涉及包養傳聞，面對外界諸多揣測，陳若思當時已經親自出面嚴正否認。她公開澄清「從未拍拖」，並強調雙方只有前上司與下屬關係，自己一直只當對方是哥哥看待。</p>\n<h2>《女神配對計劃2》熱播引發網民熱烈討論</h2>\n<p>網民對於兩位女神在節目中素顏狀態及陳若思過去背景議論紛紛。有網民在討論區留言表示「估唔到Amber以前做過咁多茄喱啡角色真係捱出嚟」，亦有人將焦點放在水族館環節上，直指「陳星妤素顏依然好靚女完全冇走樣」。針對陳若思與鍾培生緋聞，部分網民留言稱「娛樂圈啲緋聞真係信不信由你」，討論熱度持續攀升。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935112813061_10437071066af965879b336.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935112813061_10437071066af965879b336.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935288779085_9435955736af9658938cde.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935288779085_9435955736af9658938cde.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935403561889_17349708146af9658a6c8b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935403561889_17349708146af9658a6c8b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935591089810_21220424586af9658c52a70.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935591089810_21220424586af9658c52a70.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935778261471_17574336076af9658e1de38.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935778261471_17574336076af9658e1de38.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935930662931_13691797766af9658fca042.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472935930662931_13691797766af9658fca042.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936148533170_18672680696af965926ea37.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936148533170_18672680696af965926ea37.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936399894331_15644153806af96594f2f89.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936399894331_15644153806af96594f2f89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936622064966_8248575086af96596a7ef4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936622064966_8248575086af96596a7ef4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936789836277_5019370416af96598d4a34.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳若思 陳星妤 （圖片來源：YouTube截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472936789836277_5019370416af96598d4a34.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e6%98%9f%e5%a6%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳星妤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%8b%a5%e6%80%9d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳若思</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：YouTube截圖資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3543369\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 15 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:38:50.437735+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1324,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T07:56:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T12:34:45.383756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:28.828924+00:00","content_hash":"7a9cbea95a468d79a47de4d55672c198049a07893bcd5b33058d9f1d96e380fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}